.TH NCURSYS 1 "October 2026" "ncursys 1.0.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ncursys \- terminal tool for visualizing hard disk usage
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ncursys
.I path
.RB [ --threads-num=N ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
ncursys is an interactive terminal application for visualizing disk
usage as a navigable tree, built with glib and ncurses.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I path
Required. The directory path to scan.
.TP
.BI --threads-num= N
Optional. Number of worker threads to use.
.SH AUTHOR
Written by Dimitris Trivizakis.
